{"id":"vod_sn_37411","vodId":"37411","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"苍之彼方的四重奏","name_cn":"苍之彼方的四重奏","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4644590a5d4590bd8a96d751721e5c31.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个虚构的奇幻世界之中，在这里，人类不再被局限于陆地之上，而是可以自由的翱翔在天空中。地域的不受限促使一种名为“飞翔马戏团”的运动诞生了。少年日向晶也（逢坂良太 配音）曾经是这一领域内的种子选手，被寄予厚望，然而，在一次惨败之后，晶也彻底放弃了梦想和希望，之后一直都过着浑浑噩噩的生活。　　一次偶然中，晶也和一位名为仓科明日香（福圆美里 配音）的转校生相遇了，在明日香的引导和鼓励之下，晶也对于飞翔马戏团运动的热情被重新点燃。然而，他离开赛场已经太久了，再度回到舞台的中心，他能否恢复曾经的强劲实力呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YT3A9BXD9X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F2iANq8MzV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Tzgmf97WdD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Kc7JfxFA3W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mnAc2FzgPK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F94QHdqSg61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QWhPUU651V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cJS2WbDXuA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zX2C6gsuBy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TLnyaSaqkC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jg24XPQv0X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P1xLkXP8DQ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:11.105Z"}